OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump's portrait has made its
OL,7,Fway on to a US coin - the first time a
OL,8,Fliving president has appeared on
OL,9,FAmerican currency in a century.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, the US Mint launched the
OL,12,F$1 coin with a portrait of Trump
OL,13,Falongside the words "LIBERTY" and "IN
OL,14,FGOD WE TRUST", to celebrate America's
OL,15,F250th anniversary.
OL,17,FThe special-edition coin captures "the
OL,18,Fspirit, pride, and legacy of a nation
OL,19,Fapproaching its landmark anniversary",
OL,20,Fthe US Mint said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
